.TH YOGABOOK-GNSS-IMPORT 8 "August 2026" "yogabook-gnss 1.0.4"
.SH NAME
yogabook-gnss-import \- import a private Yoga Book GNSS runtime
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yogabook-gnss-import
.I RUNTIME.tar
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates and imports a user-supplied YB1-X91L Android GNSS runtime, applies
the Linux UART, rfkill and RF-plan settings, and enables the GNSS service.
The importer rejects unknown daemon versions, archive path traversal, links,
devices and unexpected files.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yogabook-gnss-build-runtime (8),
.BR yogabook-gnss-health (8)
